# Files excluded from the Moodle coding standard, with the reason.

# CI helper scripts. They deliberately bootstrap Moodle from a working directory rather than by
# including config.php in the usual place - stack-phpunit-init.php enters the PHPUnit database
# through lib/phpunit/bootstrap.php the same way Moodle's own tool_phpunit CLI does. The sniff
# cannot see that and demands a MOODLE_INTERNAL check that would be wrong here. They are also
# export-ignored, so they never reach an installed site.
.github/stack-behat-init.php
.github/stack-phpunit-init.php
.github/stack-cas-lib.php
